  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Creation and strengthening of youth networks on cultural heritage in Central America and Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Identification of existing youth groups in each country that focus on the protection, promotion or sustainable use of tangible, intangible or underwater cultural heritage. With the support of local and international partners, online and in-person activities will be organised to strengthen their skills and knowledge, and a sub-regional network will be established with the capacity to advocate for the enhancement and shared management of cultural heritage.</narrative>
  </description>
